# HealthConnect India repository hygiene

# Dependencies
**/node_modules/

# Generated build output
**/dist/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/build/
**/coverage/

# Environment and secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Logs and runtime files
**/logs/
**/*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Runtime uploads (never source-controlled)
healthconnect-api/uploads/
healthconnect-web/uploads/

# TypeScript / framework caches
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.turbo/
**/.cache/

# OS / editor files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# Temporary / backup files
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*~
